penguin-cpp (0.3.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Check for updates and Update now for macOS and APT-based Linux installs,
    with save/cancel handling and asynchronous release lookup.
  * macOS: improve toolbar wrapping, welcome screen, settings, search,
    CPU and process picker layouts; fix editor options loading.
  * Expose Attach to process in Execute; detach without ending the attached
    process and recognize the initial LLDB stop as an expected pause.
  * Avoid object name collisions in shared output directories.
  * Stage and verify macOS updates before replacing the previous app;
    restore the old app if replacement fails.
  * Add update/rollback tests, a macOS CI workflow and macOS-specific
    first-run library instructions.

 -- Juan Francisco Gonzalez Pacheco <jfgonzalez@unimagdalena.edu.co>  Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:00:00 -0500

